      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_1",
      "quote": "Background Musculoskeletal disorders (MSDs) are frequent and disabling conditions in primary care and contribute substantially to general practitioners' (GPs) workload. Direct access (DA) to physiotherapy, allowing patients to consult physiotherapists without prior medical referral, has been proposed to streamline care, reduce delays, and optimise resource use.",
      "reason": "The background/current knowledge context is described (MSDs burden; DA proposed benefits), but important uncertainties are not explicitly stated in the retrieved rationale text."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e2",
      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_1",
      "quote": "Direct access (DA) to physiotherapy, allowing patients to consult physiotherapists without prior medical referral, has been proposed to streamline care, reduce delays, and optimise resource use.",
      "reason": "A rationale for conducting the review is partially implied via the proposed aims of DA, but the importance/need for the review (why evidence is currently insufficient) is not explicitly explained in the retrieved evidence."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence retrieved describing similar systematic reviews or explaining why a current review is needed by citing previous reviews/updates/replications."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence retrieved describing a proposed mechanism of action of DA (beyond general statements in the background) in a way that matches the requirement."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e5",
      "status": "MISSING",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "No evidence retrieved considering a logic model to show hypothesised relationships between intervention components and outcomes."
    }
  ],
  "confidence": 52
